# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference material — local only, deleted by the client after Phase 8.
# `bingwa-auto-reply/` is the Google AI Studio UI generation (a separate,
# unrelated Gradle project — committing it would nest a second Android build
# inside this repo and confuse both CI and future sessions).
# `app-icons/` is the source icon export; the icons we actually ship have been
# copied into app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/.
# See memory.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bingwa-auto-reply/
app-icons/

